<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70922" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νο-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, hyperdor. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοᾱτός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Ti.Locr.
			95a
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling
				within the province of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς,</span>
			<i>mental,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φατός, ὁρατός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				8.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				509d
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. καὶ ἀσώματα εἴδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					246b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					30c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. κόσμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.5
				</span></i>
			, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθητός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1174b34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1114d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				3.10
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθητῶς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.8.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.467
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				8.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοητικός</span>
			, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mens.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς</span>”
				<i>carefully,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					23.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
